+/*
+ * Profile --gpu, boot-arg topaz_inject (kern_exec.c, topaz 0919: DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES for
+ * named programs). dyld asks the policy named "AMFI" (__mac_syscall, call 0x5a: { u64 flags
